<html lang="ko"><head><title>팀원 평점 · SocialMap</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="css/desk.css" /><meta name="csrf-token" content="<s:property value="#session.csrf"/>"><script src="js/native-forms.js" defer></script></head><body><section class="sm-workspace"><header class="sm-page-heading"><h2>팀원 평점</h2></header><h3>완료한 프로젝트</h3><s:iterator value="completed"><article class="sm-row"><span><s:property value="title"/> · 동료: <s:property value="peers"/></span><a href="RatingWrite.action?teamno=<s:property value="teamno"/>">동료 평가</a></article></s:iterator><h3>작성·받은 평점</h3><s:if test="list.size() == 0"><p class="sm-empty">함께 완료한 프로젝트의 동료에게 평점을 남길 수 있습니다.</p></s:if><s:iterator value="list"><article class="sm-row"><s:property value="sendid"/> → <s:property value="getid"/> · <s:property value="score"/>점<p><s:property value="cont"/></p></article></s:iterator></section></body></html>